# settings.func

> Module: settings (Ayarlar) | Category: CORE | is_core: TRUE

## Purpose
Tenant configuration hub. Manages company information, user accounts (CRUD), per-user module permissions, notification preferences, and plan management. The most complex CORE module with 16 frontend API calls + 5 backend endpoints.

## Problems It Solves
- Fleet owners need to manage their company profile (tax info, address, phone)
- Tenant owners must create/delete employee accounts and assign roles
- Fine-grained permission control: which modules each employee can access
- Notification channel preferences per user
- Plan upgrade path from FREE → PRO → PREMIUM

## Technical Database Structure
**Tables used:**
- `settings` — JSONB key/value per tenant (company info + notification prefs)
- `users` — User accounts managed by tenant owner
- `user_permissions` — Per-user module permissions (UNIQUE user_id, module_key)
- `modules` — Module registry for permission assignment

**Key columns:**
- `settings.key` / `settings.value` — JSONB pair for flexible config
- `user_permissions.module_key` — FK reference to modules.module_key
- `user_permissions` columns: can_view, can_create, can_edit, can_delete (all boolean)

**Permission enforcement chain:**
1. `PermissionEnforcer` middleware (permissions.go)
2. Maps URL path → module_key (21 routes)
3. Maps HTTP method → permission column
4. Queries `user_permissions` table per request
5. Returns 403 for unauthorized access

## User Interface
**SettingsPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/settings`

**Section 1: Firma Bilgileri (Company Info)**
- Firma Ünvanı, Vergi Dairesi, Vergi No, Telefon, Adres fields
- Save button with confirmation

**Section 2: Kullanıcı Yönetimi (User Management)**
- User list with name, email, role, permissions count
- "Kullanıcı Ekle" button → AddUserModal
- Delete button (Trash2 icon with confirm dialog)
- PermissionsModal: 20 modules × 4 CRUD toggles

**Section 3: Bildirim Tercihleri (Notification Preferences)**
- 5 toggle switches for notification channels
- Real API calls on toggle (PUT /api/tenant/settings/notifications)

**Section 4: Paket Bilgisi (Plan Info)**
- Current plan display (FREE/PRO/PREMIUM)
- Feature comparison list
- "PRO'ya Yükselt" button with inline fallback message

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/settings` | Tenant JWT | Get company info |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/settings` | Tenant JWT | Update company info |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/settings/notifications` | Tenant JWT | Update notification prefs |
| GET | `/api/tenant/user-management/` | Tenant JWT | List users |
| POST | `/api/tenant/user-management/` | Tenant JWT | Create user (optimistic add) |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/user-management/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Delete user |
| GET | `/api/tenant/user-management/permissions/{userId}` | Tenant JWT | Get user permissions |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/user-management/permissions/{userId}` | Tenant JWT | Save user permissions |
| GET | `/api/tenant/my-permissions` | Tenant JWT | Current user's permissions |

## Known Bugs
| ID | Severity | Bug | Status |
|----|:---:|------|:---:|
| B-QA-01 | P2 | Settings PUT returns 500 — `app.current_tenant_id` PostgreSQL variable not set by middleware. RLS policy requires it, query fails. Affects ALL tenants. | ⬜ OPEN |
| B-SET-01 | P1 | Super admin could access tenant settings (fixed: RequireTenant now rejects tid=0) | ✅ Fixed |
| B-SET-02 | P1 | Notification PUT returned success:false (fixed: explicit Success:true) | ✅ Fixed |
| B-SET-03 | P1 | Delete user button decorative (fixed: added handleDeleteUser with confirm) | ✅ Fixed |
| B-SET-04 | P2 | Notification toggles hardcoded "Yakında" (fixed: wired to API) | ✅ Fixed |
| B-SET-05 | P2 | PRO upgrade no visible response (fixed: inline upgradeMsg) | ✅ Fixed |
| B-SET-06 | P1 | User not listed after creation (fixed: optimistic add) | ✅ Fixed |

## Test Coverage
- QA test: 10/11 passed (91%) — 1 failure is B-QA-01 (settings PUT 500)
- CI gates: 6 permanent regression gates in production-integrity + security-checks jobs
